    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6654ed2ca7819a8052ce8759",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的跑法华丽且强而有力。\n出道前那天生才能就吸引了许多人，\n大家都期待她的活跃表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04e92c14ad0863e34235da69cbdd1d3665695928e6204eee71f212f623cdfb90",
